{"title":"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/4/4d482e1d4a800fdec8694fe319dcb4cb7e7f0ffc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{3,6,9,10\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" /> is augmented by a fifth element <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, not equal to any of the other four. The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Median\" title=\"Median\">median</a> of the resulting set is equal to its <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mean\" title=\"Mean\">mean</a>. What is the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b2b42f6aa022abd0d237518cf8e7f5c1ad7f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 7\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 9\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 19\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 24\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"372\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The median must either be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8bb565b22efa7ff73f411bcea23089fa3840f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6, 9,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Casework\" title=\"Casework\">Casework</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />: Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edb9ab11f778d390d264765f28b4c7a94f0cdbff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91aab5f7d4a84c90e492a8bf68e0680d2dd71464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3+6+9+10+n}{5} = 6 \\Longrightarrow n = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"265\" height=\"37\" />.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />: Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/e/bee293c2cbc11a08437617a0025ade8ebd9e800c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/b/6db1535351c543ce96e10f3eb6e4d8961265dc15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3+6+9+10+n}{5} = 9 \\Longrightarrow n = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"275\" height=\"37\" />.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />: Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/964cda810636cb07622ed25814cbe94d7dd2f5d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 &lt; n &lt; 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16a79ac322dd0b84e564103c5d93554bde7d3981.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3+6+9+10+n}{5} = n \\Longrightarrow n = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"270\" height=\"38\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>All three cases are valid, so our solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/e/e9e64064f507ddc042dd2059390b94d9df45ce4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 7 + 17 = 26 \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A\">2007 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selfl